# Hourly climate archive — a local/CI cache, NOT source of truth.
# Authoritative copy lives in Supabase; the committed derived artifacts are
# data/climate/index.json (manifest) + public/data/climate_bundle.json.
# Keeping ~26 MB of CSVs out of git stops the daily refresh job from adding
# gigabytes of blobs over a year. Regenerate with:
#   python scripts/refresh_climate.py
data/climate/hourly/
data/climate/refresh_log.json
.env*
